  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>2019年Charlotte社区义诊</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>由橄榄树基金主办、华助中心协办的夏洛特华人社区义诊2019 取得圆满成功。荣耀归于神！感谢各位用祷告、奉献、参与、关注等不同方式鼓励支持我们。这次义诊总共约有80多人参加服务（医务人员30多、工作人员20、义工22、Novant Health 体检团队10）。受益人士约150-160人次接受医疗咨询、其中有150人接受注册服务、70人次接受查血体检、50人次接种流感疫苗、42人次接受心电图检查。另外现场专门有中文翻译为大家就医提供方便。<span>社区内外对此次义诊有良好评价。夏洛特华人社区义诊将每年举办一次，同时也期待您继续支持。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;此次活动也得到当地媒体的报导和关注。&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aX33_7EtM3NbJOGRhVjsYQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">橄榄、华助联手医师奉献，患者受益</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.52hrtt.com//webservicepage_getInformationPage.do?isApp=1&amp;id=A1571055293402&amp;areaId=134&amp;languageId=1&amp;flag=1&amp;from=groupmessage&amp;isappinstalled=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">夏洛特华人社区大型免费义诊 创下医疗服务人数最多的记录&nbsp;</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery\"><img width=\"1140\" height=\"761\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_31d6.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img width=\"1140\" height=\"717\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_32ec-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img width=\"1140\" height=\"784\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_30b0-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"755\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_6827-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"748\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_318a-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"849\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_6913.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"764\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_330c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"814\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_3135-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"755\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_7008-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"777\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_30ca-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"687\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_7028.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"768\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_6951-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"767\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_6822-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"761\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_3644.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"779\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_31db.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"755\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_7010.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"769\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/DSC_6810.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"807\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_30fc-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/fullsizeoutput_3224-1024x683-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1140\" height=\"772\" src=\"/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/ful